---

<BaseLayout
  title="Eats"
  description="Happy hours and specials posted by restaurants and bars in Bastrop County, from each place’s own site."
>
  <PageHead
    kicker="Specials"
    title="Eats"
    lede="Happy hours and specials posted on a restaurant or bar’s own site. Compiled November 15, 2026. The weekly boards were read again November 16. Confirm before you go. A kids-eat-free or senior deal often has conditions that are not on the page."
  />
  <div class="wrap">
    {upcoming.length > 0 && (
      <section class="day-pair" aria-label="Today and tomorrow">
        {upcoming.map((day) => (
          <article class="detail-main">
            <p class="kicker">{day.when}</p>
            <h2>{labelFromKey(day.key)}</h2>
            <ul class="deal-list">
              {day.groups.map((group) => (
                <li class="deal">
                  {group.offers.map((offer) => (
                    <div class="deal-block">
                      <p class="deal-what">{offer.what}</p>
                      {offer.time && <p class="deal-time">{offer.time}</p>}
                      {offer.discount?.map((line) => <p class="deal-off">{line}</p>)}
                      {offer.note && <p class="deal-note">{offer.note}</p>}
                    </div>
                  ))}
                  <p class="deal-place">{group.place.name}, {group.place.city}</p>
                </li>
              ))}
            </ul>
          </article>
        ))}
      </section>
    )}
    <p class="meta">Times are Central. Casa Chapala and Chapala Fiestas & Grill are two different restaurants. Weekly boards are for November 16–22 and can change. A place is left off a day when no special is listed.</p>

    {cities.map((city) => {
      const listed = places.filter((place) => place.city === city && place.offers.length > 0);
      if (!listed.length) return null;
      return (
        <>
          <h2>{city}</h2>
          <div class="card-list">
            {listed.map((place) => (
              <article class="detail-main">
                {place.offers.map((offer) => (
                  <div class="deal-block">
                    <p class="deal-what">{offer.what}</p>
                    {(offer.span || offer.time) && <p class="deal-time">{[offer.span, offer.time].filter(Boolean).join(' · ')}</p>}
                    {offer.discount?.map((line) => <p class="deal-off">{line}</p>)}
                    {offer.note && <p class="deal-note">{offer.note}</p>}
                  </div>
                ))}
                <p class="deal-place">{place.name}</p>
                {(place.where || place.phone) && (
                  <p class="meta">
                    {place.where}
                    {place.where && place.phone && ' · '}
                    {place.phone && <a href={`tel:${place.phone.replace(/[^\d+]/g, '')}`}>{place.phone}</a>}
                  </p>
                )}
                <p class="meta"><a href={place.href}>{place.hrefLabel}</a></p>
              </article>
            ))}
          </div>
        </>
      );
    })}

    <h2>Checked, and nothing was posted</h2>
    <p>
      The November 15 pass looked at about 85 places. These had no advertised special or happy hour on their own sites that day. A Facebook or Instagram post can still be running. No standing deal was found in Cedar Creek, Paige, McDade, Red Rock, Rosanky, or Wyldwood. Store House Market & Eatery and Texas Roadhouse named hours or promotions, and neither posted a price, so they are not listed above.
    </p>
    {checked.map((group) => (
      <p>
        <strong>{group.city}.</strong> {group.names}
      </p>
    ))}
    <p>
      The same pass counted six more listings that came from a chamber page, Facebook, or an aggregator. Those rows were not in the printed directory, so they are not on this page.
    </p>
    <p class="disclaimer">
      Back 9 Bar closed January 20, 2026. Stem & Stone closed in late 2025 and is now Espadas de Brazil. Leo’s Italian Grill in Cedar Creek closed July 8, 2026, and is now Lupita’s Kitchen. Fore Fun Saloon is planned for the old Back 9 space and was not confirmed open. Send a correction if a board has changed — <a class="text-link" href="/tips">reader tips</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
